OL,3,GNEWSABest friends despite a 54-year age
OL,4,Agap
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 22-year-old woman and a 76-year-old
OL,7,Fretiree say becoming best friends has
OL,8,Ftransformed their lives and challenged
OL,9,Fwhat they thought about each other's
OL,10,Fgenerations.
OL,12,FIona Leaf met Judith Chapman at a
OL,13,Fchurch in Cheltenham when she was a
OL,14,Fstudent at the University of
OL,15,FGloucestershire and Judith was a church
OL,16,Fwarden.
OL,18,FDespite a 54-year age gap and living
OL,19,F130 miles apart, the pair now spend a
OL,20,Fweekend together every month and have
OL,21,Frecently returned from a holiday in the
OL,22,FScottish Highlands.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
