OL,3,GNEWSABest friends despite a 54-year age
OL,4,Agap
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey say they talk about everything,
OL,7,Fshare a love of cooking, art and
OL,8,Ffashion, and have challenged
OL,9,Fstereotypes about their ages along the
OL,10,Fway.
